<title>USA: St Paul hogs $2.00 lower - USDA.</title>
<headline>St Paul hogs $2.00 lower - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>ST PAUL 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were $2.00</p>
<p>lower. Top $53.50 per cwt. - USDA</p>
<p>US 1-3     220-250 lbs   53.50</p>
<p>	     250-260 lbs   53.00-53.50</p>
<p>	     260-270 lbs   52.00-53.00</p>
<p>US 2-3     270-280 lbs   51.00-52.00</p>
<p>US 2-4     280-290 lbs   50.00-51.00</p>
<p>Sows: under 550 lbs 0.50-1.50 lower; over 550 lbs steady-1.00</p>
<p>lower. Top 48.00.</p>
<p>US 1-3     300-500 lbs   44.00-45.00</p>
<p>	     500-550 lbs   45.50-46.00</p>
<p>	     550-700 lbs   47.00-48.00</p>
</text>
